LOONG (loong/)
  - Questions & task structure: Loong benchmark, "Leave No Document Behind:
    Benchmarking Long-Context LLMs with Extended Multi-Doc QA" (Wang et al., EMNLP 2024),
    Apache-2.0. https://github.com/MozerWang/Loong
