    documents). We ship references, evidence offsets, and SHA-256 hashes only; rebuild
    the documents from the Loong source (see loong/rebuild_docs.py).

BrowseComp-Plus (browsecomp_plus/)
  - We include ONLY our evidence-span annotations (offsets keyed by upstream query_id +
    doc_id). We do NOT include questions, answers, or document/evidence text: BrowseComp
    (OpenAI) asks that examples not be revealed in plain text online.
  - Questions/answers: obfuscated download + decrypt from BrowseComp-Plus (MIT):
      https://github.com/texttron/BrowseComp-Plus
  - Corpus: HuggingFace Tevatron/browsecomp-plus-corpus.
  - BrowseComp: https://openai.com/index/browsecomp/

